《窗》THE WINDOW — CREDITS

Picture
  Every frame is drawn in code (Canvas 2D, HTML/JavaScript). No video generation,
  no stock footage, no photographs.

Voice
  Mandarin narration synthesized with gTTS (Google Translate text-to-speech).
  No human recording was used. Review Google's terms before any commercial use.

Music and sound
  Original score and foley, synthesized from scratch with numpy/scipy in
  audio/score.py. No sample libraries, no existing melodies.

Fonts
  IM Fell English, Fredoka, Lilita One, ZCOOL KuaiLe — SIL Open Font License,
  from the lemo-opuscar core/fonts collection (see fonts/OFL.md).
  Source Han Serif SC, Microsoft YaHei, KaiTi, Georgia, Consolas, Bahnschrift —
  fonts present on the production system; not redistributed.

Historical references
  See FACTS.md for each claim, its source and the wording found there.
  No real building is depicted; every building is a fictional stand-in drawn
  in the grammar of its period.

Tools
  lemo-opuscar core/render (Playwright/Chromium, ffmpeg) for capture and mux;
  ffmpeg for loudness normalisation; Python for score and voice preparation.
